  "summary": "Updates `analyzepsbt` to mark a PSBT as invalid when total output amount exceeds total input amount once all input amounts are known. Instead of returning a negative fee and suggesting next roles like updater or signer, the RPC now returns an error string and sets the next role to creator.",
  "problem": "When all input amounts are known but outputs exceed inputs, `analyzepsbt` calculates a negative fee and fee rate, advising downstream roles like updater or signer for a transaction that can never be validly mined.",
